  "description": "Kang Tae-Gun was an eager but bumbling assistant firefighter. But after Sergeant Lee Chae-Yong and fellow firefighter Park Sung-Kyu are killed in a huge fire while trying to save Tae-Gun, he is no longer the man that he once was... especially now that he can see how flames move and smoke flows! Although unsure of how this ability was ignited, Tae-Gun is ready to use it to save lives. Will Tae-Gun be able to master his new power to rescue those that cry for help? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
